	| Code         | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Region       | United States                            |
	| Status       | Approved                                 |
	| Tier         | Regular                                  |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the team "Development Team"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I remove contacts with the following email addresses from the team "Development Team"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	Then I should be able to view an audit entry for the summary "Assigned Contact" related to the team with the name "Development Team" field "Contact Role" from the old value "" to the new value "Member" regarding "Koroneiki User Contact1" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for the summary "Unassigned Contact" related to the team with the name "Development Team" field "Contact Role" from the old value "Member" to the new value "" regarding "Koroneiki User Contact1" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Assign" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Team" from the old value "" to the new value "Development Team" regarding "Member" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Unassign" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Team" from the old value "Development Team" to the new value "" regarding "Member" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for the summary "Assigned Contact" related to the team with the name "Development Team" field "Contact Role" from the old value "" to the new value "Member" regarding "Koroneiki User Contact1" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for the summary "Unassigned Contact" related to the team with the name "Development Team" field "Contact Role" from the old value "Member" to the new value "" regarding "Koroneiki User Contact1" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Assign" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Team" from the old value "" to the new value "Development Team" regarding "Member" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Unassign" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Team" from the old value "Development Team" to the new value "" regarding "Member" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key

